        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "4a0ac1b2-3c7b-548b-8b9c-d677f9879ce6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ansel Elgort, Neal Dodson, Edgar Wright, Selena Gomez, Jane Lynch, Katia Winter, Rachel Keller, Ashley Williams, Marilu Henner, Mireille Enos, Sam Shepard, Kristin Wiig\n- Films: Carrie, The Divergent Series, The Fault in Our Stars, Baby Driver, Another Cinderella Story, Banshee Chapter, Hollidaysburg, Jonathan, Love On A Limb, Never Here, Periods, Hateship, Loveship\n- Roles: Tommy Ross, Caleb Prior, Augustus Waters, Baby\n- Concepts: film acting, executive producing, co-producing, plot\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Ansel Elgort played Tommy Ross in the horror film \"Carrie.\"\n- In 2014, Ansel Elgort played Augustus Waters in the romantic teen drama \"The Fault in Our Stars.\"\n- Ansel Elgort played Caleb Prior in \"The Divergent Series\" franchise.\n- In 2017, Ansel Elgort played the title character in Edgar Wright's action thriller \"Baby Driver.\"\n- \"Baby Driver\" follows Baby, a young getaway driver and music lover who must work for a kingpin.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Another Cinderella Story,\" which starred Selena Gomez and Jane Lynch.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Banshee Chapter,\" which starred Katia Winter.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Hollidaysburg,\" which starred Rachel Keller.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Jonathan,\" which starred Ansel Elgort.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Love On A Limb,\" which starred Ashley Williams and Marilu Henner.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Never Here,\" which starred Mireille Enos and Sam Shepard.\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Periods.\"\n- Neal Dodson co-produced \"Hateship, Loveship,\" which starred Kristin Wiig.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
